  "why_this_one": "The Dark Lord's Paewang set (docs/plans/dark-lord-gear.md batch 5; OpenMU's rows, drop 98-132, lords only). The user, 2026-10-25: 'we need missing Dark lord items', 'make missing peices'. Level 380 (MuMain's item.bmd; the user picked it for Paewang), so Kanturu gear through sim::kanturuGear.",
